,"text":"Amy 星期六洗了衣服。"},{"key":"D","text":"Amy 星期日洗了衣服。"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"washed her clothes on Saturday。","verify":"\"Amy 星期六洗了衣服。\""},{"id":"cne_p188_q3","topicId":"cne_p188","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Did you stay at home? Yes, I did. 这个人待在家里了吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"没有"},{"key":"B","text":"去了公园"},{"key":"C","text":"没回答"},{"key":"D","text":"待了"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"Yes, I did。","verify":"\"待了\""},{"id":"cne_p188_q4","topicId":"cne_p188","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I watched a film on Sunday. 星期日做了什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"看了一部电影"},{"key":"B","text":"打扫了房间"},{"key":"C","text":"洗了衣服"},{"key":"D","text":"去旅行了"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"watched a film。","verify":"\"看了一部电影\""},{"id":"cne_p241_q1","topicId":"cne_p241","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「打扫房间」的过去式短语是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"cleaned my room"},{"key":"B","text":"clean my room"},{"key":"C","text":"cleaning my room"},{"key":"D","text":"cleans my room"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"clean 的过去式是 cleaned。","verify":"\"cleaned my room\""},{"id":"cne_p241_q2","topicId":"cne_p241","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"stayed at home 的意思是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"去了公园"},{"key":"B","text":"看了电影"},{"key":"C","text":"洗了衣服"},{"key":"D","text":"待在家里"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"stayed at home 是待在家里。","verify":"\"待在家里\""},{"id":"cne_p241_q3","topicId":"cne_p241","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"「洗衣服」用哪一组？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"washing clothes"},{"key":"B","text":"washes clothes"},{"key":"C","text":"washed my clothes"},{"key":"D","text":"wash my clothes yesterday"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"washed my clothes。","verify":"\"washed my clothes\""},{"id":"cne_p241_q4","topicId":"cne_p241","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"had a cold 是在说什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"去滑雪了"},{"key":"B","text":"感冒了"},{"key":"C","text":"很冷"},{"key":"D","text":"喝了冷饮"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"had a cold 是感冒了。","verify":"\"感冒了\""},{"id":"cne_p242_q1","topicId":"cne_p242","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问「你上周末打扫房间了吗？」，应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Did you clean your room last weekend?"},{"key":"B","text":"Did you cleaned your room last weekend?"},{"key":"C","text":"Do you cleaned your room?"},{"key":"D","text":"Did you cleaning your room?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"Did + 主语 + 动词原形。","verify":"\"Did you clean your room last weekend?\""},{"id":"cne_p242_q2","topicId":"cne_p242","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"—Did you stay at home? —Yes, I ____.","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"do"},{"key":"B","text":"does"},{"key":"C","text":"didn't stay"},{"key":"D","text":"did"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"肯定简答用 did。","verify":"\"did\""},{"id":"cne_p242_q3","topicId":"cne_p242","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Did they washing?"},{"key":"B","text":"Do they washed?"},{"key":"C","text":"Did they wash their clothes?"},{"key":"D","text":"Did they washed their clothes?"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Did 后用原形 wash。","verify":"\"Did they wash their clothes?\""},{"id":"cne_p242_q4","topicId":"cne_p242","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"—Did you see a film? —No, I ____.","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"wasn't"},{"key":"B","text":"didn't"},{"key":"C","text":"did"},{"key":"D","text":"don't"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"否定简答用 didn't。","verify":"\"didn't\""},{"id":"cne_p243_q1","topicId":"cne_p243","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问「你周末过得怎么样？」，应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"How was your weekend?"},{"key":"B","text":"How is your weekend yesterday?"},{"key":"C","text":"How were you weekend?"},{"key":"D","text":"How did your weekend?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"How was your weekend?","verify":"\"How was your weekend?\""},{"id":"cne_p243_q2","topicId":"cne_p243","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"—How was your weekend? —It was good. 周末怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"不好"},{"key":"B","text":"还没过"},{"key":"C","text":"不知道"},{"key":"D","text":"很好"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"It was good。","verify":"\"很好\""},{"id":"cne_p243_q3","topicId":"cne_p243","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句评价上周末不好？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It was a book."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, I do every day."},{"key":"C","text":"It wasn't good."},{"key":"D","text":"It is tomorrow."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"wasn't good 表示不好。","verify":"\"It wasn't good.\""},{"id":"cne_p243_q4","topicId":"cne_p243","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"—How was your weekend? —____. I stayed at home and slept.","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Yes, I clean"},{"key":"B","text":"It was OK"},{"key":"C","text":"It is Monday"},{"key":"D","text":"I am a weekend"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"用 It was … 评价。","verify":"\"It was OK\""},{"id":"cne_p244_q1","topicId":"cne_p244","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想说「我上周末洗衣服了，很忙」，应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I washed my clothes last weekend. It was busy."},{"key":"B","text":"I wash my clothes last weekend."},{"key":"C","text":"I washing clothes yesterday."},{"key":"D","text":"I washes my clothes."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"过去式 washed；评价 It was busy。","verify":"\"I washed my clothes last weekend. It was busy.\""},{"id":"cne_p244_q2","topicId":"cne_p244","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"I didn't go out. I had a cold. 我怎么了？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"去看电影了"},{"key":"B","text":"去公园了"},{"key":"C","text":"很开心出门"},{"key":"D","text":"感冒了，没出门"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"had a cold; didn't go out。","verify":"\"感冒了，没出门\""},{"id":"cne_p244_q3","topicId":"cne_p244","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一组能完整谈上周末？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I cleaning now only."},{"key":"B","text":"Clean room I yesterday."},{"key":"C","text":"I cleaned my room. It was good."},{"key":"D","text":"I clean my room tomorrow."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"过去式 + 评价。","verify":"\"I cleaned my room. It was good.\""},{"id":"cne_p244_q4","topicId":"cne_p244","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"—What did you do last weekend? —____.","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I reads a book."},{"key":"B","text":"I read a book at home."},{"key":"C","text":"I read a book tomorrow."},{"key":"D","text":"I reading a book now every day."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"用过去式回答。","verify":"\"I read a book at home.\""}]
